</svg></div><div class="brxe-block value-row"><div id="brxe-tgbg2" class="brxe-image value-row__media tag"><img width="2048" height="1365" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20width='2048'%20height='1365'%20viewBox='0%200%202048%201365'%3E%3C/svg%3E" class="css-filter size-full perfmatters-lazy" alt decoding="async" data-src="https://craft-conf.com/2027/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/workshops.webp" data-srcset="https://craft-conf.com/2027/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/workshops.webp 2048w, https://craft-conf.com/2027/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/workshops-300x200.webp 300w, https://craft-conf.com/2027/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/workshops-1024x683.webp 1024w, https://craft-conf.com/2027/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/workshops-768x512.webp 768w, https://craft-conf.com/2027/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/workshops-1536x1024.webp 1536w" data-sizes="(max-width: 2048px) 100vw, 2048px" /></div><div class="brxe-block value-row__body"><div class="brxe-image value-row__icon tag"><img width="184" height="192" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20width='184'%20height='192'%20viewBox='0%200%20184%20192'%3E%3C/svg%3E" class="css-filter size-full perfmatters-lazy" alt decoding="async" data-src="https://craft-conf.com/2027/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/value-icon-masterclass.webp" /></div><div class="brxe-block value-row__copy"><h3 class="brxe-heading value-row__title">Masterclass</h3><p class="brxe-text-basic value-row__text">Pre-event and on-site deep dives led by top tech partners – focused strictly on core tech mechanics, with zero vendor pitches.</p></div></div><svg class="brxe-svg value-row__barcode" preserveAspectRatio="none" overflow="visible" style="display: block;" width="113.323" height="55" viewBox="0 0 113.323 55" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
