</svg><div  class="brxe-container features__inner"><h2 class="brxe-heading section-title__heading features__heading">Craft by the numbers</h2><div class="brxe-block features__row"><div class="brxe-block features__col features__col--left"><div class="brxe-block feature-cell"><div class="brxe-image feature-cell__icon tag"><img width="204" height="206" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20width='204'%20height='206'%20viewBox='0%200%20204%20206'%3E%3C/svg%3E" class="css-filter size-full perfmatters-lazy" alt decoding="async" data-src="https://craft-conf.com/2027/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/72456742747.webp" data-srcset="https://craft-conf.com/2027/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/72456742747.webp 204w, https://craft-conf.com/2027/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/72456742747-150x150.webp 150w" data-sizes="(max-width: 204px) 100vw, 204px" /></div><p class="brxe-text-basic feature-cell__stat">2000+</p><p class="brxe-text-basic feature-cell__label">Attendees</p></div><div class="brxe-block feature-cell"><div class="brxe-image feature-cell__icon tag"><img width="204" height="206" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20width='204'%20height='206'%20viewBox='0%200%20204%20206'%3E%3C/svg%3E" class="css-filter size-full perfmatters-lazy" alt decoding="async" data-src="https://craft-conf.com/2027/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/7457457275247.webp" data-srcset="https://craft-conf.com/2027/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/7457457275247.webp 204w, https://craft-conf.com/2027/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/7457457275247-150x150.webp 150w" data-sizes="(max-width: 204px) 100vw, 204px" /></div><p class="brxe-text-basic feature-cell__stat">80+</p><p class="brxe-text-basic feature-cell__label">Speakers</p></div></div><div class="brxe-block features__col features__col--hub"><div class="brxe-block feature-hub"><div class="brxe-image feature-hub__glow tag"><img width="2613" height="2613" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20