_trigger"><p class="brxe-text-basic value-split__tagline anim--1_element">Aftermovie</p><h2 class="brxe-heading section-title__heading section-title__heading--on-dark anim--1_element">The best reason to go AFK.</h2><p class="brxe-text-basic section-title__lede section-title__lede--on-dark anim--1_element">Conversations you can’t replicate on a video call. Relive the unscripted debates, hallway insights, and atmosphere of our ‘26 edition.</p></div><div class="brxe-block media-feature__player anim--1_trigger"><div data-script-id="akngby" class="brxe-video media-feature__video anim--1_element"><iframe loading="lazy" allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; fullscreen; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share" referrerpolicy="strict-origin-when-cross-origin" src="https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/m-7JVIDw4gM?wmode=opaque&#038;autoplay=1&#038;mute=1&#038;rel=0&#038;enablejsapi=1&#038;origin=https%3A%2F%2Fcraft-conf.com"></iframe></div></div></div></section><section  class="brxe-section cta-banner"><div  data-script-id="ctbvnt" class="brxe-video speakers__decor cta-banner__nut"><video src="https://craft-conf.com/2027/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/csavar-3d-elem-blur-feher-hatter.webm" preload="auto" autoplay playsinline onclick="this.paused ? this.play() : this.pause()" loop muted><p>Your browser does not support the video tag.</p></video></div><div  class="brxe-container cta-banner__inner"><div class="brxe-block cta-banner__card"><div class="brxe-block cta-banner__media"><img width="799" height="532" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20width='799'%20height='532'%20viewBox='0%200%20799%20532'%3E%3C/svg%3E" class="brxe-image cta-banner__photo css-filter size-full perfmatters-lazy" alt decoding="async" data-src="https://craft-conf.com/2027/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/cta-banner-photo.webp" /><div class="brxe-block cta-banner__overlay"></div><svg class="brxe-svg speakers__decor cta-banner__glow cta-banner__glow--lef