</svg></div><span class="brxe-text-basic">Sponsors</span></a></div></section><section data-wpr-lazyrender="1" class="brxe-section articles"><div  class="brxe-container articles__inner"><div class="brxe-block section-title anim--1_trigger"><h2 class="brxe-heading section-title__heading anim--1_element">Inside the minds you’ll meet</h2></div><div class="brxe-block articles__grid anim--1_trigger"><a href="https://craft-conf.com/2027/blog/craft-conference-2027-from-promises-to-value-copy/" class="brxe-blgcrd brxe-block blog-card" data-brx-loop-start="blgcrd"><div class="brxe-blgimg brxe-image blog-card__media tag"><img width="1024" height="683" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20width='1024'%20height='683'%20viewBox='0%200%201024%20683'%3E%3C/svg%3E" class="css-filter size-large perfmatters-lazy" alt="Meet the Minds Shaping Software Engineering: First Keynote Revealed and 13 New Speakers" decoding="async" data-src="https://craft-conf.com/2027/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/2019-1024x683.webp" data-srcset="https://craft-conf.com/2027/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/2019-1024x683.webp 1024w, https://craft-conf.com/2027/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/2019-300x200.webp 300w, https://craft-conf.com/2027/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/2019-768x512.webp 768w, https://craft-conf.com/2027/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/2019-1536x1025.webp 1536w, https://craft-conf.com/2027/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/2019.webp 2000w" data-sizes="(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px" /></div><div class="brxe-blgbdy brxe-block blog-card__body anim--1_element"><div class="brxe-blgmet brxe-block blog-card__meta"><div class="brxe-blgtrm brxe-block blog-card__term" data-brx-loop-start="blgtrm"><span class="brxe-blgtag brxe-text-basic chip">News</span></div><div class="brx-query-trail" data-query-element-id="blgtrm" data-query-vars="{&quot;disable_query_merge&quot;:true,&quot;posts_per_page&quot;:&quot;1&quot;,&quot;taxonomy&quot;:[&quot;category&quot;],&quot;number&quot;:&quot;10&quot;,&quot;paged&quot;:1,&quot;original_offset&quot;:0,&quot;object_ids&quot;:3798,&quot;_bricks_query_signature&quot;:&quot;6bb8016d785b9d87466b5e5b60045888692eac0b4a6304fb23dc2c5e228c0415&quot;}" data-original-query-vars="[]" data-page="1" data-max-pages="1" data-start="1" data-end="1"></div><span class="brxe-blgdat brxe-text-basic blog-card__date">2026. 11. 19.</span></div><h6 class="brxe-blgttl brxe-heading blog-card__title">Meet the Minds Shaping Software Engineering: First Keynote Revealed and 13 New Speakers</h6><p class="brxe-blgexc brxe-text-basic blog-card__excerpt">Some of the people shaping the future of software engineering are coming to Budapest - and we're just getting started! We're excited to announce Gojko Adzic as the first keynote...</p></div></a><a href="https://craft-conf.com/2027/blog/craft-conference-2027-from-promises-to-value/" class="brxe-blgcrd brxe-block blog-card"><div class="brxe-blgimg brxe-image blog-card__media tag"><img width="1024" height="575" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20width='1024'%20height='575'%20viewBox='0%200%201024%20575'%3E%3C/svg%3E" class="css-filter size-large perfmatters-lazy" alt="Craft Conference 2027: From Promises to Value" decoding="async" data-src="https://craft-conf.com/2027/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/55340386803_c40c9048f1_o-1024x575.jpg" data-srcset="https://craft-conf.com/2027/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/55340386803_c40c9048f1_o-1024x575.jpg 1024w, https://craft-conf.com/2027/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/55340386803_c40c9048f1_o-300x169.jpg 300w, https://craft-conf.com/2027/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/55340386803_c40c9048f1_o-768x432.jpg 768w, https://craft-conf.com/2027/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/55340386803_c40c9048f1_o-1536x863.jpg 1536w, https://craft-conf.com/2027/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/55340386803_c40c9048f1_o-2048x1151.jpg 2048w" data-sizes="(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px" /></div><div class="brxe-blgbdy brxe-block blog-card__body anim--1_element"><div class="brxe-blgmet brxe-block blog-card__meta"><div class="brxe-blgtrm brxe-block blog-card__term" data-brx-loop-start="blgtrm"><span class="brxe-blgtag brxe-text-basic chip">News</span></div><div class="brx-query-trail" data-query-element-id="blgtrm" data-query-vars="{&quot;disable_query_merge&quot;:true,&quot;posts_per_page&quot;:&quot;1&quot;,&quot;taxonomy&quot;:[&quot;category&quot;],&quot;number&quot;:&quot;10&quot;,&quot;paged&quot;:1,&quot;original_offset&quot;:0,&quot;object_ids&quot;:3659,&quot;_bricks_query_signature&quot;:&quot;90cbafa6551028755bf4603453993245dd889c02329a98e9926bca072664d415&quot;}" data-original-query-vars="[]" data-page="1" data-max-pages="1" data-start="1" data-end="1"></div><span class="brxe-blgdat brxe-text-basic blog-card__date">2026. 11. 02.</span></div><h6 class="brxe-blgttl brxe-heading blog-card__title">Craft Conference 2027: From Promises to Value</h6><p class="brxe-blgexc brxe-text-basic blog-card__excerpt">The countdown to Craft Conference 2027 has begun! On 3-4 June, Budapest will once again welcome 2,000+ software engineers, architects and tech leaders for two days of fresh perspectives, practical...</p></div></a><a href="https://craft-conf.com/2027/blog/craft-conference-2026-navigating-the-future-of-engineering-in-the-age-of-ai/" class="brxe-blgcrd brxe-block blog-card"><div class="brxe-blgimg brxe-image blog-card__media tag"><img width="1024" height="683" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20width='1024'%20height='683'%20viewBox='0%200%201024%20683'%3E%3C/svg%3E" class="css-filter size-large perfmatters-lazy" alt="Craft Conference 2026: Navigating the Future of Engineering in the Age of AI" decoding="async" data-src="https://craft-conf.com/2027/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/55340425094_9730919579_o-1024x683-1.jpg" data-srcset="https://craft-conf.com/2027/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/55340425094_9730919579_o-1024x683-1.jpg 1024w, https://craft-conf.com/2027/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/55340425094_9730919579_o-1024x683-1-300x200.jpg 300w, https://craft-conf.com/2027/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/55340425094_9730919579_o-1024x683-1-768x512.jpg 768w" data-sizes="(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px" /></div><div class="brxe-blgbdy brxe-block blog-card__body anim--1_element"><div class="brxe-blgmet brxe-block blog-card__meta"><div class="brxe-blgtrm brxe-block blog-card__term" data-brx-loop-start="blgtrm"><span class="brxe-blgtag brxe-text-basic chip">News</span></div><div class="brx-query-trail" data-query-element-id="blgtrm" data-query-vars="{&quot;disable_query_merge&quot;:true,&quot;posts_per_page&quot;:&quot;1&quot;,&quot;taxonomy&quot;:[&quot;category&quot;],&quot;number&quot;:&quot;10&quot;,&quot;paged&quot;:1,&quot;original_offset&quot;:0,&quot;object_ids&quot;:3228,&quot;_bricks_query_signature&quot;:&quot;70786302ac48e03c925a62171031d36ba7718f08036743d8cea08719e44eb643&quot;}" data-original-query-vars="[]" data-page="1" data-max-pages="1" data-start="1" data-end="1"></div><span class="brxe-blgdat brxe-text-basic blog-card__date">2026. 06. 19.</span></div><h6 class="brxe-blgttl brxe-heading blog-card__title">Craft Conference 2026: Navigating the Future of Engineering in the Age of AI</h6><p class="brxe-blgexc brxe-text-basic blog-card__excerpt">Another chapter of Craft Conference has officially come to an end, leaving a lasting impression on everyone involved. On June 4-5, Budapest once again transformed into a global tech hub as more than...</p></div></a><a href="https://craft-conf.com/2027/blog/engineering-the-inflection-point-the-craft-2026-masterclass-strategy/" class="brxe-blgcrd brxe-block blog-card"><div class="brxe-blgimg brxe-image blog-card__media tag"><img width="1024" height="683" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20width='1024'%20height='683'%20viewBox='0%200%201024%20683'%3E%3C/svg%3E" class="css-filter size-large perfmatters-lazy" alt="Engineering the Inflection Point: The Craft 2026 Masterclass Strategy" decoding="async" data-src="https://craft-conf.com/2027/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/54579458916_4a63f6b116_k-1024x683-1.jpg" data-srcset="https://craft-conf.com/2027/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/54579458916_4a63f6b116_k-1024x683-1.jpg 1024w, https://craft-conf.com/2027/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/54579458916_4a63f6b116_k-1024x683-1-300x200.jpg 300w, https://craft-conf.com/2027/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/54579458916_4a63f6b116_k-1024x683-1-768x512.jpg 768w" data-sizes="(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px" /></div><div class="brxe-blgbdy brxe-block blog-card__body anim--1_element"><div class="brxe-blgmet brxe-block blog-card__meta"><div class="brxe-blgtrm brxe-block blog-card__term" data-brx-loop-start="blgtrm"><span class="brxe-blgtag brxe-text-basic chip">Masterclasses</span></div><div class="brx-query-trail" data-query-element-id="blgtrm" data-query-vars="{&quot;disable_query_merge&quot;:true,&quot;posts_per_page&quot;:&quot;1&quot;,&quot;taxonomy&quot;:[&quot;category&quot;],&quot;number&quot;:&quot;10&quot;,&quot;paged&quot;:1,&quot;original_offset&quot;:0,&quot;object_ids&quot;:3235,&quot;_bricks_query_signature&quot;:&quot;831352dff0f246be7b1b081b634067e8dedf4bc4c6f59232acd2072fbccb7124&quot;}" data-original-query-vars="[]" data-page="1" data-max-pages="1" data-start="1" data-end="1"></div><span class="brxe-blgdat brxe-text-basic blog-card__date">2026. 04. 07.</span></div><h6 class="brxe-blgttl brxe-heading blog-card__title">Engineering the Inflection Point: The Craft 2026 Masterclass Strategy</h6><p class="brxe-blgexc brxe-text-basic blog-card__excerpt">In a world where technology evolves faster than ever, staying relevant is no longer optional – it’s essential. This is exactly where Craft Conference masterclasses step in, offering a focused, hands-on learning...</p></div></a><a class="brx-query-trail" data-query-element-id="blgcrd" data-query-vars="{&quot;post_type&quot;:[&quot;post&quot;],&quot;posts_per_page&quot;:4,&quot;disable_query_merge&quot;:true,&quot;order&quot;:&quot;DESC