</svg></div><h2 class="brxe-heading section-title__heading anim--1_element">You’re hard to fool.<br>Lucky we never tried.</h2><p class="brxe-text-basic section-title__lede section-title__lede--light anim--1_element">Developers have the sharpest bullshit detectors in tech. Here is what they had to say.</p></div><div data-script-id="tstgrd" class="brxe-slider-nested testimonials-slider splide" data-splide="{&quot;type&quot;:&quot;loop&quot;,&quot;perPage&quot;:4,&quot;perMove&quot;:1,&quot;gap&quot;:&quot;2rem&quot;,&quot;arrows&quot;:false,&quot;pagination&quot;:false,&quot;autoplay&quot;:false,&quot;pauseOnHover&quot;:true,&quot;drag&quot;:&quot;free&quot;,&quot;autoScroll&quot;:{&quot;speed&quot;:0.5,&quot;pauseOnHover&quot;:true,&quot;pauseOnFocus&quot;:false},&quot;breakpoints&quot;:{&quot;991&quot;:{&quot;perPage&quot;:2},&quot;478&quot;:{&quot;perPage&quot;:1}}}"><div class="splide__track"><div class="splide__list"><div class="brxe-tstcrd brxe-block testimonial" data-brx-loop-start="tstcrd"><svg class="brxe-tststr brxe-svg testimonial__stars" preserveAspectRatio="none" overflow="visible" style="display: block;" width="116" height="18.8889" viewBox="0 0 116 18.8889" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
