</svg><h6 class="brxe-tstqte brxe-heading testimonial__quote">I love the fact speakers walk among attendees and we can talk with them. There are so many great presentations, it is hard to follow all. Great organization, great venue. Keep up the good work!</h6><div class="brxe-tstpsn brxe-block testimonial__person"><div class="brxe-tstimg brxe-image testimonial__avatar tag"><img width="196" height="196" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20width='196'%20height='196'%20viewBox='0%200%20196%20196'%3E%3C/svg%3E" class="css-filter size-medium perfmatters-lazy" alt="Gábor Barna" decoding="async" data-src="https://craft-conf.com/2027/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Gabor-Barna-d9796647df9059f1cc12e8fab06b6a65.webp" data-srcset="https://craft-conf.com/2027/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Gabor-Barna-d9796647df9059f1cc12e8fab06b6a65.webp 196w, https://craft-conf.com/2027/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Gabor-Barna-d9796647df9059f1cc12e8fab06b6a65-150x150.webp 150w" data-sizes="(max-width: 196px) 100vw, 196px" /></div><div class="brxe-tstidn brxe-block testimonial__identity"><span class="brxe-tstnam brxe-text-basic testimonial__name">Gábor Barna</span><div class="brxe-tstrol brxe-block testimonial__role"><span class="brxe-tstpos brxe-text-basic testimonial__meta">Team coach, developer</span><span class="brxe-tstcmp brxe-text-basic testimonial__company">Ericsson</span></div></div></div></div><div class="brxe-tstcrd brxe-block testimonial"><svg class="brxe-tststr brxe-svg testimonial__stars" preserveAspectRatio="none" overflow="visible" style="display: block;" width="116" height="18.8889" viewBox="0 0 116 18.8889" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
