</svg><h6 class="brxe-tstqte brxe-heading testimonial__quote">I have heard about Craft from my company. The all over experience was great. Many companies, good networking opportunities and presentations. I will come next year as well.</h6><div class="brxe-tstpsn brxe-block testimonial__person"><div class="brxe-tstimg brxe-image testimonial__avatar tag"><img width="196" height="196" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20width='196'%20height='196'%20viewBox='0%200%20196%20196'%3E%3C/svg%3E" class="css-filter size-medium perfmatters-lazy" alt="Kovács Tamás" decoding="async" data-src="https://craft-conf.com/2027/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Kovacs-Tamas-cc899651dedafe78c3d2448be3e93600.webp" data-srcset="https://craft-conf.com/2027/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Kovacs-Tamas-cc899651dedafe78c3d2448be3e93600.webp 196w, https://craft-conf.com/2027/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Kovacs-Tamas-cc899651dedafe78c3d2448be3e93600-150x150.webp 150w" data-sizes="(max-width: 196px) 100vw, 196px" /></div><div class="brxe-tstidn brxe-block testimonial__identity"><span class="brxe-tstnam brxe-text-basic testimonial__name">Kovács Tamás</span><div class="brxe-tstrol brxe-block testimonial__role"><span class="brxe-tstpos brxe-text-basic testimonial__meta">Software Engineer</span><span class="brxe-tstcmp brxe-text-basic testimonial__company">Cloudera</span></div></div></div></div><div class="brxe-tstcrd brxe-block testimonial"><svg class="brxe-tststr brxe-svg testimonial__stars" preserveAspectRatio="none" overflow="visible" style="display: block;" width="116" height="18.8889" viewBox="0 0 116 18.8889" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
