</svg><h6 class="brxe-tstqte brxe-heading testimonial__quote">Craft gave me the opportunity to meet Kent Beck. He was one of the people that I learnt my skills from during my learning journey as a developer. It was quite an honour to meet him &amp; a lot of world class speakers at Craft.</h6><div class="brxe-tstpsn brxe-block testimonial__person"><div class="brxe-tstimg brxe-image testimonial__avatar tag"><img width="196" height="196" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20width='196'%20height='196'%20viewBox='0%200%20196%20196'%3E%3C/svg%3E" class="css-filter size-medium perfmatters-lazy" alt="Susan Fung" decoding="async" data-src="https://craft-conf.com/2027/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Susan-Fung-6f74cab3230a7d020fd47062e009c355.webp" data-srcset="https://craft-conf.com/2027/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Susan-Fung-6f74cab3230a7d020fd47062e009c355.webp 196w, https://craft-conf.com/2027/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Susan-Fung-6f74cab3230a7d020fd47062e009c355-150x150.webp 150w" data-sizes="(max-width: 196px) 100vw, 196px" /></div><div class="brxe-tstidn brxe-block testimonial__identity"><span class="brxe-tstnam brxe-text-basic testimonial__name">Susan Fung</span><div class="brxe-tstrol brxe-block testimonial__role"><span class="brxe-tstpos brxe-text-basic testimonial__meta">Software Developer</span></div></div></div></div><div class="brx-query-trail" data-query-element-id="tstcrd" data-query-vars="{&quot;disable_query_merge&quot;:true,&quot;orderby&quot;:{&quot;date ID&quot;:&quot;DESC&quot;},&quot;post_type&quot;:[&quot;testimonial&quot;],&quot;posts_per_page&quot;:-1,&quot;post_status&quot;:&quot;publish&quot;,&quot;paged&quot;:1,&quot;_bricks_query_signature&quot;:&quot;476848028cd2d64fdf14387bcf835ea731a9049cc66ce3dcc3fef44340f0ddb0&quot;}" data-original-query-vars="[]" data-page="1" data-max-pages="-16" data-start="1" data-end="16"></div></div></div></div><script>(function () {
  var SEL = '.testimonials-slider';
