</svg><div  data-script-id="faqvnt" class="brxe-video faq__starburst"><video src="https://craft-conf.com/2027/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/fogaskerek-3d-elem-feher-hatter.webm" preload="auto" autoplay playsinline onclick="this.paused ? this.play() : this.pause()" loop muted><p>Your browser does not support the video tag.</p></video></div><div  class="brxe-container faq__inner"><div class="brxe-block section-title section-title--narrow anim--1_trigger"><h2 class="brxe-heading section-title__heading anim--1_element">FAQs</h2><p class="brxe-text-basic section-title__lede anim--1_element">A quick guide to the questions we hear most often.</p></div><div data-script-id="faqlst" class="brxe-accordion-nested faq__list anim--1_trigger" data-expand-item="0"><div class="brxe-block faq__item anim--1_element"><div class="brxe-block faq__question-row accordion-title-wrapper" role="button" aria-expanded="false" tabindex="0" aria-controls="accordion-content-71c19995-0d79-4e9a-b8aa-d13596eb27ec"><h3 class="brxe-heading faq__question" id="accordion-title-c20b25f8-41f6-4ccd-aae0-29ac02f8a005">What is Craft Conference?</h3><svg class="brxe-icon faq__icon brx-icon-transform" id="brxe-fqk00" preserveaspectratio="none" overflow="visible" style="display: block;" width="32" height="32" viewbox="0 0 32 32" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
<g id="keyboard_arrow_up">
<path id="Vector" d="M15.9998 11.6058C16.1249 11.6058 16.2251 11.6436 16.3319 11.7503L22.9246 18.3421C23.0338 18.4513 23.0691 18.55 23.0692 18.6663C23.0692 18.7826 23.0338 18.8813 22.9246 18.9906C22.8206 19.0946 22.7181 19.135 22.5838 19.1351C22.4493 19.1351 22.3462 19.0947 22.242 18.9906L22.241 18.9896L16.4705 13.2513L15.9989 12.7826L9.75765 19.0238C9.654 19.1274 9.56536 19.1566 9.45785 19.1527C9.33216 19.1481 9.22395 19.1053 9.10921 18.9906C9.00507 18.8864 8.96468 18.7843 8.96468 18.6497C8.96469 18.5152 9.00506 18.4131 9.10921 18.3089L15.6678 11.7503C15.7746 11.6436 15.8748 11.6058 15.9998 11.6058Z" fill="black" stroke="black" stroke-width="1.33333"></path>
</g>
</svg></div><div class="brxe-block accordion-content-wrapper" id="accordion-content-71c19995-0d79-4e9a-b8aa-d13596eb27ec" role="region" aria-labelledby="accordion-title-c20b25f8-41f6-4ccd-aae0-29ac02f8a005"><div class="brxe-text faq__answer"><p><span style="font-weight: 400;">Craft Conference is an international software engineering conference focused on the craft of building great software.</span></p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">It brings together practitioners and experts from across the industry to share real-world experience, technical knowledge, and lessons learned from building complex systems at scale.</span></p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">The conference is known for its strong engineering focus, practical talks, and high-quality content spanning software architecture, development practices, AI-assisted engineering, and product development.</span></p>
</div></div></div><div class="brxe-block faq__item anim--1_element"><div class="brxe-block faq__question-row accordion-title-wrapper" role="button" aria-expanded="false" tabindex="0" aria-controls="accordion-content-71078d8f-0441-4d03-8c33-c69fa63eaefa"><h3 class="brxe-heading faq__question" id="accordion-title-84446532-d9aa-4c24-9dc3-eef47b88cc5e">Who should attend?</h3><svg class="brxe-icon faq__icon brx-icon-transform" id="brxe-ppbfln" preserveaspectratio="none" overflow="visible" style="display: block;" width="32" height="32" viewbox="0 0 32 32" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
<g id="keyboard_arrow_up">
<path id="Vector" d="M15.9998 11.6058C16.1249 11.6058 16.2251 11.6436 16.3319 11.7503L22.9246 18.3421C23.0338 18.4513 23.0691 18.55 23.0692 18.6663C23.0692 18.7826 23.0338 18.8813 22.9246 18.9906C22.8206 19.0946 22.7181 19.135 22.5838 19.1351C22.4493 19.1351 22.3462 19.0947 22.242 18.9906L22.241 18.9896L16.4705 13.2513L15.9989 12.7826L9.75765 19.0238C9.654 19.1274 9.56536 19.1566 9.45785 19.1527C9.33216 19.1481 9.22395 19.1053 9.10921 18.9906C9.00507 18.8864 8.96468 18.7843 8.96468 18.6497C8.96469 18.5152 9.00506 18.4131 9.10921 18.3089L15.6678 11.7503C15.7746 11.6436 15.8748 11.6058 15.9998 11.6058Z" fill="black" stroke="black" stroke-width="1.33333"></path>
</g>
</svg></div><div class="brxe-block accordion-content-wrapper" id="accordion-content-71078d8f-0441-4d03-8c33-c69fa63eaefa" role="region" aria-labelledby="accordion-title-84446532-d9aa-4c24-9dc3-eef47b88cc5e"><div class="brxe-text faq__answer"><p><span style="font-weight: 400;">Craft Conference is designed for software developers, engineers, architects, data professionals, product managers, designers, and tech leaders – as well as decision-makers shaping technology strategy in their organizations.</span></p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">It’s for anyone who wants to understand how modern software is built at scale, how AI is reshaping engineering and product development, and how strong technical practices translate into better products and businesses.</span></p>
</div></div></div><div class="brxe-block faq__item anim--1_element"><div class="brxe-block faq__question-row accordion-title-wrapper" role="button" aria-expanded="false" tabindex="0" aria-controls="accordion-content-cca42c6f-9466-40a3-893e-8c8f5bfe7dc7"><h3 class="brxe-heading faq__question" id="accordion-title-ae839eea-5d89-4bc3-954d-2dbf06918fe6">What is a hybrid conference?</h3><svg class="brxe-icon faq__icon brx-icon-transform" id="brxe-dwxden" preserveaspectratio="none" overflow="visible" style="display: block;" width="32" height="32" viewbox="0 0 32 32" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
<g id="keyboard_arrow_up">
<path id="Vector" d="M15.9998 11.6058C16.1249 11.6058 16.2251 11.6436 16.3319 11.7503L22.9246 18.3421C23.0338 18.4513 23.0691 18.55 23.0692 18.6663C23.0692 18.7826 23.0338 18.8813 22.9246 18.9906C22.8206 19.0946 22.7181 19.135 22.5838 19.1351C22.4493 19.1351 22.3462 19.0947 22.242 18.9906L22.241 18.9896L16.4705 13.2513L15.9989 12.7826L9.75765 19.0238C9.654 19.1274 9.56536 19.1566 9.45785 19.1527C9.33216 19.1481 9.22395 19.1053 9.10921 18.9906C9.00507 18.8864 8.96468 18.7843 8.96468 18.6497C8.96469 18.5152 9.00506 18.4131 9.10921 18.3089L15.6678 11.7503C15.7746 11.6436 15.8748 11.6058 15.9998 11.6058Z" fill="black" stroke="black" stroke-width="1.33333"></path>
</g>
</svg></div><div class="brxe-block accordion-content-wrapper" id="accordion-content-cca42c6f-9466-40a3-893e-8c8f5bfe7dc7" role="region" aria-labelledby="accordion-title-ae839eea-5d89-4bc3-954d-2dbf06918fe6"><div class="brxe-text faq__answer"><p><span style="font-weight: 400;">Craft Conference is going to be a hybrid event which means attendees can join online as well as in-person.</span></p>
</div></div></div><div class="brxe-block faq__item anim--1_element"><div class="brxe-block faq__question-row accordion-title-wrapper" role="button" aria-expanded="false" tabindex="0" aria-controls="accordion-content-90e13232-c00a-4db9-b215-66f031ebb8ae"><h3 class="brxe-heading faq__question" id="accordion-title-ea1c30da-0b30-4158-9728-e6c53514c5a9">Can I purchase a ticket by invoice?</h3><svg class="brxe-icon faq__icon brx-icon-transform" id="brxe-bykwbq" preserveaspectratio="none" overflow="visible" style="display: block;" width="32" height="32" viewbox="0 0 32 32" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
<g id="keyboard_arrow_up">
<path id="Vector" d="M15.9998 11.6058C16.1249 11.6058 16.2251 11.6436 16.3319 11.7503L22.9246 18.3421C23.0338 18.4513 23.0691 18.55 23.0692 18.6663C23.0692 18.7826 23.0338 18.8813 22.9246 18.9906C22.8206 19.0946 22.7181 19.135 22.5838 19.1351C22.4493 19.1351 22.3462 19.0947 22.242 18.9906L22.241 18.9896L16.4705 13.2513L15.9989 12.7826L9.75765 19.0238C9.654 19.1274 9.56536 19.1566 9.45785 19.1527C9.33216 19.1481 9.22395 19.1053 9.10921 18.9906C9.00507 18.8864 8.96468 18.7843 8.96468 18.6497C8.96469 18.5152 9.00506 18.4131 9.10921 18.3089L15.6678 11.7503C15.7746 11.6436 15.8748 11.6058 15.9998 11.6058Z" fill="black" stroke="black" stroke-width="1.33333"></path>
</g>
</svg></div><div class="brxe-block accordion-content-wrapper" id="accordion-content-90e13232-c00a-4db9-b215-66f031ebb8ae" role="region" aria-labelledby="accordion-title-ea1c30da-0b30-4158-9728-e6c53514c5a9"><div class="brxe-text faq__answer"><p><span style="font-weight: 400;">Yes, please write an email to </span><a href="https://craft-conf.com/2026/hello@crafthub.events"><span style="font-weight: 400;"><span class="__cf_email__" data-cfemail="d3bbb6bfbfbc93b0a1b2b5a7bba6b1fdb6a5b6bda7a0">[email&#160;protected]</span></span></a><span style="font-weight: 400;">. Make sure to include the number and type of tickets that you would like to purchase, your company name, billing address, and VAT number in the email.</span></p>
</div></div></div><div class="brxe-block faq__item anim--1_element"><div class="brxe-block faq__question-row accordion-title-wrapper" role="button" aria-expanded="false" tabindex="0" aria-controls="accordion-content-4e4c42c8-b929-4b50-99d2-e3c72b3b7f92"><h3 class="brxe-heading faq__question" id="accordion-title-6b05fa18-fc5e-467c-ac0d-dcecce86d9b6">Will the talks be recorded?</h3><svg class="brxe-icon faq__icon brx-icon-transform" id="brxe-yehzai" preserveaspectratio="none" overflow="visible" style="display: block;" width="32" height="32" viewbox="0 0 32 32" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
<g id="keyboard_arrow_up">
<path id="Vector" d="M15.9998 11.6058C16.1249 11.6058 16.2251 11.6436 16.3319 11.7503L22.9246 18.3421C23.0338 18.4513 23.0691 18.55 23.0692 18.6663C23.0692 18.7826 23.0338 18.8813 22.9246 18.9906C22.8206 19.0946 22.7181 19.135 22.5838 19.1351C22.4493 19.1351 22.3462 19.0947 22.242 18.9906L22.241 18.9896L16.4705 13.2513L15.9989 12.7826L9.75765 19.0238C9.654 19.1274 9.56536 19.1566 9.45785 19.1527C9.33216 19.1481 9.22395 19.1053 9.10921 18.9906C9.00507 18.8864 8.96468 18.7843 8.96468 18.6497C8.96469 18.5152 9.00506 18.4131 9.10921 18.3089L15.6678 11.7503C15.7746 11.6436 15.8748 11.6058 15.9998 11.6058Z" fill="black" stroke="black" stroke-width="1.33333"></path>
</g>
</svg></div><div class="brxe-block accordion-content-wrapper" id="accordion-content-4e4c42c8-b929-4b50-99d2-e3c72b3b7f92" role="region" aria-labelledby="accordion-title-6b05fa18-fc5e-467c-ac0d-dcecce86d9b6"><div class="brxe-text faq__answer"><p><span style="font-weight: 400;">Yes. All sessions will be recorded and shared with participants after the event.</span></p>
</div></div></div><div class="brxe-block faq__item anim--1_element"><div class="brxe-block faq__question-row accordion-title-wrapper" role="button" aria-expanded="false" tabindex="0" aria-controls="accordion-content-590430ce-5de2-49d5-89ab-d7105645bb06"><h3 class="brxe-heading faq__question" id="accordion-title-6639c4e1-5407-499d-9221-dc2892b554f1">Can I access the slides and videos of the talks after the conference?</h3><svg class="brxe-icon faq__icon brx-icon-transform" id="brxe-uzeymd" preserveaspectratio="none" overflow="visible" style="display: block;" width="32" height="32" viewbox="0 0 32 32" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
<g id="keyboard_arrow_up">
<path id="Vector" d="M15.9998 11.6058C16.1249 11.6058 16.2251 11.6436 16.3319 11.7503L22.9246 18.3421C23.0338 18.4513 23.0691 18.55 23.0692 18.6663C23.0692 18.7826 23.0338 18.8813 22.9246 18.9906C22.8206 19.0946 22.7181 19.135 22.5838 19.1351C22.4493 19.1351 22.3462 19.0947 22.242 18.9906L22.241 18.9896L16.4705 13.2513L15.9989 12.7826L9.75765 19.0238C9.654 19.1274 9.56536 19.1566 9.45785 19.1527C9.33216 19.1481 9.22395 19.1053 9.10921 18.9906C9.00507 18.8864 8.96468 18.7843 8.96468 18.6497C8.96469 18.5152 9.00506 18.4131 9.10921 18.3089L15.6678 11.7503C15.7746 11.6436 15.8748 11.6058 15.9998 11.6058Z" fill="black" stroke="black" stroke-width="1.33333"></path>
</g>
</svg></div><div class="brxe-block accordion-content-wrapper" id="accordion-content-590430ce-5de2-49d5-89ab-d7105645bb06" role="region" aria-labelledby="accordion-title-6639c4e1-5407-499d-9221-dc2892b554f1"><div class="brxe-text faq__answer"><p><span style="font-weight: 400;">We will share all presentations and recordings where the speaker authorized us to do so. If you attended the conference we will send you an email as soon as they are available. Please note: the slides and videos will only be available for those who have attended Craft Conference.</span></p>
</div></div></div><div class="brxe-block faq__item anim--1_element"><div class="brxe-block faq__question-row accordion-title-wrapper" role="button" aria-expanded="false" tabindex="0" aria-controls="accordion-content-e07b5c57-0f9a-4789-a6d8-ed8c65224916"><h3 class="brxe-heading faq__question" id="accordion-title-e20a0ae0-6804-446b-a918-016eeb52349e">How can I join the conference?</h3><svg class="brxe-icon faq__icon brx-icon-transform" id="brxe-eoeoqa" preserveaspectratio="none" overflow="visible" style="display: block;" width="32" height="32" viewbox="0 0 32 32" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
<g id="keyboard_arrow_up">
<path id="Vector" d="M15.9998 11.6058C16.1249 11.6058 16.2251 11.6436 16.3319 11.7503L22.9246 18.3421C23.0338 18.4513 23.0691 18.55 23.0692 18.6663C23.0692 18.7826 23.0338 18.8813 22.9246 18.9906C22.8206 19.0946 22.7181 19.135 22.5838 19.1351C22.4493 19.1351 22.3462 19.0947 22.242 18.9906L22.241 18.9896L16.4705 13.2513L15.9989 12.7826L9.75765 19.0238C9.654 19.1274 9.56536 19.1566 9.45785 19.1527C9.33216 19.1481 9.22395 19.1053 9.10921 18.9906C9.00507 18.8864 8.96468 18.7843 8.96468 18.6497C8.96469 18.5152 9.00506 18.4131 9.10921 18.3089L15.6678 11.7503C15.7746 11.6436 15.8748 11.6058 15.9998 11.6058Z" fill="black" stroke="black" stroke-width="1.33333"></path>
</g>
</svg></div><div class="brxe-block accordion-content-wrapper" id="accordion-content-e07b5c57-0f9a-4789-a6d8-ed8c65224916" role="region" aria-labelledby="accordion-title-e20a0ae0-6804-446b-a918-016eeb52349e"><div class="brxe-text faq__answer"><p><span style="font-weight: 400;">Craft Conference will be held in person this year at the Hungarian Railway Museum.</span></p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">As Craft is going to be hybrid, participants have the opportunity to join the conference online as well with the help of our virtual event platform.</span></p>
</div></div></div><div class="brxe-block faq__item anim--1_element"><div class="brxe-block faq__question-row accordion-title-wrapper" role="button" aria-expanded="false" tabindex="0" aria-controls="accordion-content-f6cf8b22-3971-465a-9748-dcfa56f62f21"><h3 class="brxe-heading faq__question" id="accordion-title-59a61d76-d63a-431e-bdb0-357e4d6b7dde">How can I connect with fellow attendees?</h3><svg class="brxe-icon faq__icon brx-icon-transform" id="brxe-exwlay" preserveaspectratio="none" overflow="visible" style="display: block;" width="32" height="32" viewbox="0 0 32 32" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
<g id="keyboard_arrow_up">
<path id="Vector" d="M15.9998 11.6058C16.1249 11.6058 16.2251 11.6436 16.3319 11.7503L22.9246 18.3421C23.0338 18.4513 23.0691 18.55 23.0692 18.6663C23.0692 18.7826 23.0338 18.8813 22.9246 18.9906C22.8206 19.0946 22.7181 19.135 22.5838 19.1351C22.4493 19.1351 22.3462 19.0947 22.242 18.9906L22.241 18.9896L16.4705 13.2513L15.9989 12.7826L9.75765 19.0238C9.654 19.1274 9.56536 19.1566 9.45785 19.1527C9.33216 19.1481 9.22395 19.1053 9.10921 18.9906C9.00507 18.8864 8.96468 18.7843 8.96468 18.6497C8.96469 18.5152 9.00506 18.4131 9.10921 18.3089L15.6678 11.7503C15.7746 11.6436 15.8748 11.6058 15.9998 11.6058Z" fill="black" stroke="black" stroke-width="1.33333"></path>
</g>
</svg></div><div class="brxe-block accordion-content-wrapper" id="accordion-content-f6cf8b22-3971-465a-9748-dcfa56f62f21" role="region" aria-labelledby="accordion-title-59a61d76-d63a-431e-bdb0-357e4d6b7dde"><div class="brxe-text faq__answer"><p><span style="font-weight: 400;">Everyone is open and approachable, so feel free to start conversations. In addition, there will be a networking party on the first evening, which you are more than welcome to attend!</span></p>
</div></div></div><div class="brxe-block faq__item anim--1_element"><div class="brxe-block faq__question-row accordion-title-wrapper" role="button" aria-expanded="false" tabindex="0" aria-controls="accordion-content-c64ed582-48e0-4d99-bf81-2b7a11141b09"><h3 class="brxe-heading faq__question" id="accordion-title-e1e41726-8f51-442b-9fc1-4e6372e7da4f">How do I get tickets?</h3><svg class="brxe-icon faq__icon brx-icon-transform" id="brxe-bfseqy" preserveaspectratio="none" overflow="visible" style="display: block;" width="32" height="32" viewbox="0 0 32 32" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
<g id="keyboard_arrow_up">
<path id="Vector" d="M15.9998 11.6058C16.1249 11.6058 16.2251 11.6436 16.3319 11.7503L22.9246 18.3421C23.0338 18.4513 23.0691 18.55 23.0692 18.6663C23.0692 18.7826 23.0338 18.8813 22.9246 18.9906C22.8206 19.0946 22.7181 19.135 22.5838 19.1351C22.4493 19.1351 22.3462 19.0947 22.242 18.9906L22.241 18.9896L16.4705 13.2513L15.9989 12.7826L9.75765 19.0238C9.654 19.1274 9.56536 19.1566 9.45785 19.1527C9.33216 19.1481 9.22395 19.1053 9.10921 18.9906C9.00507 18.8864 8.96468 18.7843 8.96468 18.6497C8.96469 18.5152 9.00506 18.4131 9.10921 18.3089L15.6678 11.7503C15.7746 11.6436 15.8748 11.6058 15.9998 11.6058Z" fill="black" stroke="black" stroke-width="1.33333"></path>
</g>
</svg></div><div class="brxe-block accordion-content-wrapper" id="accordion-content-c64ed582-48e0-4d99-bf81-2b7a11141b09" role="region" aria-labelledby="accordion-title-e1e41726-8f51-442b-9fc1-4e6372e7da4f"><div class="brxe-text faq__answer"><p><span style="font-weight: 400;">Tickets can be purchased through the official event website.</span></p>
</div></div></div><div class="brxe-block faq__item anim--1_element"><div class="brxe-block faq__question-row accordion-title-wrapper" role="button" aria-expanded="false" tabindex="0" aria-controls="accordion-content-1d75005d-eba2-4ce3-8069-ed658b8edb17"><h3 class="brxe-heading faq__question" id="accordion-title-e7116da1-540d-4d23-9380-e1f97563e0ac">Can I transfer my ticket to someone else?</h3><svg class="brxe-icon faq__icon brx-icon-transform" id="brxe-skfmde" preserveaspectratio="none" overflow="visible" style="display: block;" width="32" height="32" viewbox="0 0 32 32" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
<g id="keyboard_arrow_up">
<path id="Vector" d="M15.9998 11.6058C16.1249 11.6058 16.2251 11.6436 16.3319 11.7503L22.9246 18.3421C23.0338 18.4513 23.0691 18.55 23.0692 18.6663C23.0692 18.7826 23.0338 18.8813 22.9246 18.9906C22.8206 19.0946 22.7181 19.135 22.5838 19.1351C22.4493 19.1351 22.3462 19.0947 22.242 18.9906L22.241 18.9896L16.4705 13.2513L15.9989 12.7826L9.75765 19.0238C9.654 19.1274 9.56536 19.1566 9.45785 19.1527C9.33216 19.1481 9.22395 19.1053 9.10921 18.9906C9.00507 18.8864 8.96468 18.7843 8.96468 18.6497C8.96469 18.5152 9.00506 18.4131 9.10921 18.3089L15.6678 11.7503C15.7746 11.6436 15.8748 11.6058 15.9998 11.6058Z" fill="black" stroke="black" stroke-width="1.33333"></path>
</g>
</svg></div><div class="brxe-block accordion-content-wrapper" id="accordion-content-1d75005d-eba2-4ce3-8069-ed658b8edb17" role="region" aria-labelledby="accordion-title-e7116da1-540d-4d23-9380-e1f97563e0ac"><div class="brxe-text faq__answer"><p><span style="font-weight: 400;">Yes. If you can’t attend, you can transfer your ticket to someone else up to 14 days before the event. Just contact us and we’ll update the registration details for you.</span></p>
</div></div></div><div class="brxe-block faq__item anim--1_element"><div class="brxe-block faq__question-row accordion-title-wrapper" role="button" aria-expanded="false" tabindex="0" aria-controls="accordion-content-5fd7b0e3-2fc3-405f-8f1c-d470bdf2a82a"><h3 class="brxe-heading faq__question" id="accordion-title-c555665f-0f8d-4395-a893-1fe2b46cf210">Do you offer team discounts?</h3><svg class="brxe-icon faq__icon brx-icon-transform" id="brxe-rvejzw" preserveaspectratio="none" overflow="visible" style="display: block;" width="32" height="32" viewbox="0 0 32 32" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
<g id="keyboard_arrow_up">
<path id="Vector" d="M15.9998 11.6058C16.1249 11.6058 16.2251 11.6436 16.3319 11.7503L22.9246 18.3421C23.0338 18.4513 23.0691 18.55 23.0692 18.6663C23.0692 18.7826 23.0338 18.8813 22.9246 18.9906C22.8206 19.0946 22.7181 19.135 22.5838 19.1351C22.4493 19.1351 22.3462 19.0947 22.242 18.9906L22.241 18.9896L16.4705 13.2513L15.9989 12.7826L9.75765 19.0238C9.654 19.1274 9.56536 19.1566 9.45785 19.1527C9.33216 19.1481 9.22395 19.1053 9.10921 18.9906C9.00507 18.8864 8.96468 18.7843 8.96468 18.6497C8.96469 18.5152 9.00506 18.4131 9.10921 18.3089L15.6678 11.7503C15.7746 11.6436 15.8748 11.6058 15.9998 11.6058Z" fill="black" stroke="black" stroke-width="1.33333"></path>
</g>
</svg></div><div class="brxe-block accordion-content-wrapper" id="accordion-content-5fd7b0e3-2fc3-405f-8f1c-d470bdf2a82a" role="region" aria-labelledby="accordion-title-c555665f-0f8d-4395-a893-1fe2b46cf210"><div class="brxe-text faq__answer"><p><span style="font-weight: 400;">Yes. If you’re planning to attend with your team, we offer special group discounts. Attending together is a great way to learn faster, share ideas, and bring the most value back to your company. If you’d like a team offer, just contact us at </span><a href="/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection#375f525b5b587754455651435f425519524152594344"><span style="font-weight: 400;"><span class="__cf_email__" data-cfemail="a4ccc1c8c8cbe4c7d6c5c2d0ccd1c68ac1d2c1cad0d7">[email&#160;protected]</span></span></a><span style="font-weight: 400;"> and we’ll send you the details.</span></p>
</div></div></div><div class="brxe-block faq__item anim--1_element"><div class="brxe-block faq__question-row accordion-title-wrapper" role="button" aria-expanded="false" tabindex="0" aria-controls="accordion-content-7d377f32-2251-4b43-9e64-74851fd1182b"><h3 class="brxe-heading faq__question" id="accordion-title-fdff42e1-e149-4a1a-8f5b-09a94b09ff59">What is included in the ticket price?</h3><svg class="brxe-icon faq__icon brx-icon-transform" id="brxe-dbhmhf" preserveaspectratio="none" overflow="visible" style="display: block;" width="32" height="32" viewbox="0 0 32 32" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
<g id="keyboard_arrow_up">
<path id="Vector" d="M15.9998 11.6058C16.1249 11.6058 16.2251 11.6436 16.3319 11.7503L22.9246 18.3421C23.0338 18.4513 23.0691 18.55 23.0692 18.6663C23.0692 18.7826 23.0338 18.8813 22.9246 18.9906C22.8206 19.0946 22.7181 19.135 22.5838 19.1351C22.4493 19.1351 22.3462 19.0947 22.242 18.9906L22.241 18.9896L16.4705 13.2513L15.9989 12.7826L9.75765 19.0238C9.654 19.1274 9.56536 19.1566 9.45785 19.1527C9.33216 19.1481 9.22395 19.1053 9.10921 18.9906C9.00507 18.8864 8.96468 18.7843 8.96468 18.6497C8.96469 18.5152 9.00506 18.4131 9.10921 18.3089L15.6678 11.7503C15.7746 11.6436 15.8748 11.6058 15.9998 11.6058Z" fill="black" stroke="black" stroke-width="1.33333"></path>
</g>
</svg></div><div class="brxe-block accordion-content-wrapper" id="accordion-content-7d377f32-2251-4b43-9e64-74851fd1182b" role="region" aria-labelledby="accordion-title-fdff42e1-e149-4a1a-8f5b-09a94b09ff59"><div class="brxe-text faq__answer"><p><span style="font-weight: 400;">Your ticket gives you full access to the entire Craft Conference experience. This includes access to all conference tracks, expert talks, panel discussions, and networking opportunities throughout the day. You’ll also receive access to the recorded sessions and presentation slides after the event, so you can revisit the most valuable insights anytime.</span></p>
</div></div></div><div class="brxe-block faq__item anim--1_element"><div class="brxe-block faq__question-row accordion-title-wrapper" role="button" aria-expanded="false" tabindex="0" aria-controls="accordion-content-fbd2e191-8ac4-432b-ad41-e86aec6c43e1"><h3 class="brxe-heading faq__question" id="accordion-title-91cbbdb8-e58e-4f11-8edb-04ad0a812ce1">Is food and coffee included?</h3><svg class="brxe-icon faq__icon brx-icon-transform" id="brxe-ajcrxc" preserveaspectratio="none" overflow="visible" style="display: block;" width="32" height="32" viewbox="0 0 32 32" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
<g id="keyboard_arrow_up">
<path id="Vector" d="M15.9998 11.6058C16.1249 11.6058 16.2251 11.6436 16.3319 11.7503L22.9246 18.3421C23.0338 18.4513 23.0691 18.55 23.0692 18.6663C23.0692 18.7826 23.0338 18.8813 22.9246 18.9906C22.8206 19.0946 22.7181 19.135 22.5838 19.1351C22.4493 19.1351 22.3462 19.0947 22.242 18.9906L22.241 18.9896L16.4705 13.2513L15.9989 12.7826L9.75765 19.0238C9.654 19.1274 9.56536 19.1566 9.45785 19.1527C9.33216 19.1481 9.22395 19.1053 9.10921 18.9906C9.00507 18.8864 8.96468 18.7843 8.96468 18.6497C8.96469 18.5152 9.00506 18.4131 9.10921 18.3089L15.6678 11.7503C15.7746 11.6436 15.8748 11.6058 15.9998 11.6058Z" fill="black" stroke="black" stroke-width="1.33333"></path>
</g>
</svg></div><div class="brxe-block accordion-content-wrapper" id="accordion-content-fbd2e191-8ac4-432b-ad41-e86aec6c43e1" role="region" aria-labelledby="accordion-title-91cbbdb8-e58e-4f11-8edb-04ad0a812ce1"><div class="brxe-text faq__answer"><p><span style="font-weight: 400;">Yes. Your ticket includes coffee, refreshments, and lunch during the conference day. It also includes dinner on the first day. We make sure you can focus on learning, networking, and enjoying the event without worrying about logistics.</span></p>
</div></div></div><div class="brxe-block faq__item anim--1_element"><div class="brxe-block faq__question-row accordion-title-wrapper" role="button" aria-expanded="false" tabindex="0" aria-controls="accordion-content-f8fd71ae-3bd3-46e6-8445-e8bd96c32128"><h3 class="brxe-heading faq__question" id="accordion-title-40f44a76-4f1a-47b5-a6f0-2895101c8e81">How can I become a volunteer?</h3><svg class="brxe-icon faq__icon brx-icon-transform" id="brxe-nrkoaw" preserveaspectratio="none" overflow="visible" style="display: block;" width="32" height="32" viewbox="0 0 32 32" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
<g id="keyboard_arrow_up">
<path id="Vector" d="M15.9998 11.6058C16.1249 11.6058 16.2251 11.6436 16.3319 11.7503L22.9246 18.3421C23.0338 18.4513 23.0691 18.55 23.0692 18.6663C23.0692 18.7826 23.0338 18.8813 22.9246 18.9906C22.8206 19.0946 22.7181 19.135 22.5838 19.1351C22.4493 19.1351 22.3462 19.0947 22.242 18.9906L22.241 18.9896L16.4705 13.2513L15.9989 12.7826L9.75765 19.0238C9.654 19.1274 9.56536 19.1566 9.45785 19.1527C9.33216 19.1481 9.22395 19.1053 9.10921 18.9906C9.00507 18.8864 8.96468 18.7843 8.96468 18.6497C8.96469 18.5152 9.00506 18.4131 9.10921 18.3089L15.6678 11.7503C15.7746 11.6436 15.8748 11.6058 15.9998 11.6058Z" fill="black" stroke="black" stroke-width="1.33333"></path>
</g>
</svg></div><div class="brxe-block accordion-content-wrapper" id="accordion-content-f8fd71ae-3bd3-46e6-8445-e8bd96c32128" role="region" aria-labelledby="accordion-title-40f44a76-4f1a-47b5-a6f0-2895101c8e81"><div class="brxe-text faq__answer"><p><span style="font-weight: 400;">If you’d like to join the Craft Conference team as a volunteer, we’d love to hear from you.</span></p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">Please send us an email at </span><a href="/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection#f49c9198989bb497869592809c8196da9182919a8087"><b><span class="__cf_email__" data-cfemail="78101d141417381b0a191e0c100d1a561d0e1d160c0b">[email&#160;protected]</span></b></a><span style="font-weight: 400;">, and we’ll get back to you with all the details about available roles, timing, and how you can get involved.</span></p>
</div></div></div><div class="brxe-block faq__item anim--1_element"><div class="brxe-block faq__question-row accordion-title-wrapper" role="button" aria-expanded="false" tabindex="0" aria-controls="accordion-content-885eab19-1b57-4880-bf02-a8351716a623"><h3 class="brxe-heading faq__question" id="accordion-title-b55788ed-2c58-405d-b7ff-83ca56f9cb6c">Can I apply as a speaker?</h3><svg class="brxe-icon faq__icon brx-icon-transform" id="brxe-ricagu" preserveaspectratio="none" overflow="visible" style="display: block;" width="32" height="32" viewbox="0 0 32 32" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
<g id="keyboard_arrow_up">
<path id="Vector" d="M15.9998 11.6058C16.1249 11.6058 16.2251 11.6436 16.3319 11.7503L22.9246 18.3421C23.0338 18.4513 23.0691 18.55 23.0692 18.6663C23.0692 18.7826 23.0338 18.8813 22.9246 18.9906C22.8206 19.0946 22.7181 19.135 22.5838 19.1351C22.4493 19.1351 22.3462 19.0947 22.242 18.9906L22.241 18.9896L16.4705 13.2513L15.9989 12.7826L9.75765 19.0238C9.654 19.1274 9.56536 19.1566 9.45785 19.1527C9.33216 19.1481 9.22395 19.1053 9.10921 18.9906C9.00507 18.8864 8.96468 18.7843 8.96468 18.6497C8.96469 18.5152 9.00506 18.4131 9.10921 18.3089L15.6678 11.7503C15.7746 11.6436 15.8748 11.6058 15.9998 11.6058Z" fill="black" stroke="black" stroke-width="1.33333"></path>
</g>
</svg></div><div class="brxe-block accordion-content-wrapper" id="accordion-content-885eab19-1b57-4880-bf02-a8351716a623" role="region" aria-labelledby="accordion-title-b55788ed-2c58-405d-b7ff-83ca56f9cb6c"><div class="brxe-text faq__answer"><p><span style="font-weight: 400;">The Call for Papers (CFP) is usually open for the upcoming Craft Conference until </span><b>November each year</b><span style="font-weight: 400;">.</span></p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">You can always find the current CFP status on the </span><b>Speakers page</b><span style="font-weight: 400;"> of the website. If the CFP is open, the application form and all necessary details will be available there.</span></p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">We encourage early applications, as review and selection happen on a rolling basis.</span></p>
</div></div></div><div class="brxe-block faq__item anim--1_element"><div class="brxe-block faq__question-row accordion-title-wrapper" role="button" aria-expanded="false" tabindex="0" aria-controls="accordion-content-75a1f87b-e849-474f-b70d-0729f7a89dff"><h3 class="brxe-heading faq__question" id="accordion-title-3572502a-9ea9-4afc-8250-4ee83e6f5dd4">I’m interested in sponsoring the conference. How can I do that?</h3><svg class="brxe-icon faq__icon brx-icon-transform" id="brxe-kfcznx" preserveaspectratio="none" overflow="visible" style="display: block;" width="32" height="32" viewbox="0 0 32 32" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
<g id="keyboard_arrow_up">
<path id="Vector" d="M15.9998 11.6058C16.1249 11.6058 16.2251 11.6436 16.3319 11.7503L22.9246 18.3421C23.0338 18.4513 23.0691 18.55 23.0692 18.6663C23.0692 18.7826 23.0338 18.8813 22.9246 18.9906C22.8206 19.0946 22.7181 19.135 22.5838 19.1351C22.4493 19.1351 22.3462 19.0947 22.242 18.9906L22.241 18.9896L16.4705 13.2513L15.9989 12.7826L9.75765 19.0238C9.654 19.1274 9.56536 19.1566 9.45785 19.1527C9.33216 19.1481 9.22395 19.1053 9.10921 18.9906C9.00507 18.8864 8.96468 18.7843 8.96468 18.6497C8.96469 18.5152 9.00506 18.4131 9.10921 18.3089L15.6678 11.7503C15.7746 11.6436 15.8748 11.6058 15.9998 11.6058Z" fill="black" stroke="black" stroke-width="1.33333"></path>
</g>
</svg></div><div class="brxe-block accordion-content-wrapper" id="accordion-content-75a1f87b-e849-474f-b70d-0729f7a89dff" role="region" aria-labelledby="accordion-title-3572502a-9ea9-4afc-8250-4ee83e6f5dd4"><div class="brxe-text faq__answer"><p><span style="font-weight: 400;">If you’d like to become a sponsor of Craft Conference, please reach out to us directly at </span><a href="/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection#422a272e2e2d0221302324362a37206c2734272c3631"><b><span class="__cf_email__" data-cfemail="066e636a6a694665746760726e736428637063687275">[email&#160;protected]</span></b></a><span style="font-weight: 400;"> or check out our </span><b>Sponsors</b><span style="font-weight: 400;"> page.</span></p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">Our team will share the available sponsorship packages, partnership opportunities, and help you find the best fit for your goals – whether that’s brand visibility, recruitment, or community engagement.</span></p>
</div></div></div><div class="brxe-block faq__item anim--1_element"><div class="brxe-block faq__question-row accordion-title-wrapper" role="button" aria-expanded="false" tabindex="0" aria-controls="accordion-content-17ce0172-cbcc-4c3d-8594-3267f6df6c82"><h3 class="brxe-heading faq__question" id="accordion-title-5ac77648-0361-4c37-9f69-7e414419008a">Where is the conference located?</h3><svg class="brxe-icon faq__icon brx-icon-transform" id="brxe-sohrmp" preserveaspectratio="none" overflow="visible" style="display: block;" width="32" height="32" viewbox="0 0 32 32" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
<g id="keyboard_arrow_up">
<path id="Vector" d="M15.9998 11.6058C16.1249 11.6058 16.2251 11.6436 16.3319 11.7503L22.9246 18.3421C23.0338 18.4513 23.0691 18.55 23.0692 18.6663C23.0692 18.7826 23.0338 18.8813 22.9246 18.9906C22.8206 19.0946 22.7181 19.135 22.5838 19.1351C22.4493 19.1351 22.3462 19.0947 22.242 18.9906L22.241 18.9896L16.4705 13.2513L15.9989 12.7826L9.75765 19.0238C9.654 19.1274 9.56536 19.1566 9.45785 19.1527C9.33216 19.1481 9.22395 19.1053 9.10921 18.9906C9.00507 18.8864 8.96468 18.7843 8.96468 18.6497C8.96469 18.5152 9.00506 18.4131 9.10921 18.3089L15.6678 11.7503C15.7746 11.6436 15.8748 11.6058 15.9998 11.6058Z" fill="black" stroke="black" stroke-width="1.33333"></path>
</g>
</svg></div><div class="brxe-block accordion-content-wrapper" id="accordion-content-17ce0172-cbcc-4c3d-8594-3267f6df6c82" role="region" aria-labelledby="accordion-title-5ac77648-0361-4c37-9f69-7e414419008a"><div class="brxe-text faq__answer"><p><span style="font-weight: 400;">Craft Conference takes place at the Magyar Vasúttörténeti Park in Budapest, Hungary.</span></p>
<p><b>Address:</b><b><br></b><span style="font-weight: 400;">Budapest, Tatai u. 95, 1142</span></p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">The venue, also known as the Hungarian Railway History Park, is Europe’s first interactive railway museum located at a former railway station and workshop of the Hungarian State Railways.</span></p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">You can find more details, directions, and travel information on the </span><b>Location</b> <b>page</b><span style="font-weight: 400;">.</span></p>
</div></div></div></div></div></section><section  class="brxe-section cta-banner"><div  data-script-id="ctbvnt" class="brxe-video speakers__decor cta-banner__nut"><video src="https://craft-conf.com/2027/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/csavar-3d-elem-blur-feher-hatter.webm" preload="auto" autoplay playsinline onclick="this.paused ? this.play() : this.pause()" loop muted><p>Your browser does not support the video tag.</p></video></div><div  class="brxe-container cta-banner__inner"><div class="brxe-block cta-banner__card"><div class="brxe-block cta-banner__media"><img width="799" height="532" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20width='799'%20height='532'%20viewBox='0%200%20799%20532'%3E%3C/svg%3E" class="brxe-image cta-banner__photo css-filter size-full perfmatters-lazy" alt decoding="async" data-src="https://craft-conf.com/2027/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/cta-banner-photo.webp" /><div class="brxe-block cta-banner__overlay"></div><svg class="brxe-svg speakers__decor cta-banner__glow cta-banner__glow--left" width="744.866" height="850.078" viewBox="0 0 744.866 850.078" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
