</svg></div><div class="brxe-block cta-banner__content"><div class="brxe-block cta-banner__heading"><span class="brxe-text-basic cta-banner__accent">Secure</span><h2 class="brxe-heading cta-banner__title">your spot!</h2></div><p class="brxe-text-basic cta-banner__lede">Hard problems solved on stage.<br> Great conversations and energy off stage.</p><div class="brxe-block cta-banner__actions"><div class="brxe-block cta-banner__buy"><a href="https://craft-conf.com/2027/tickets/" class="brxe-div btn btn--primary"><div class="brxe-div btn__icon"><svg class="brxe-svg btn__arrow" preserveAspectRatio="none" overflow="visible" style="display: block;" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
